  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hx-grid\" aria-label=\"Articles\">\n      <div class=\"hx-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"hx-cards\">\n          <a class=\"hx-card\" href=\"/insights/interior-design-cost-pakistan/\" data-ih-reveal=\"\">\n            <figure><img src=\"/assets/img/img-774a712057fc.webp\" alt=\"Warm Woodex living room interior\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"hx-date\">6 min read</span></figure>\n            <h3>What interior design costs in Pakistan</h3><p>Design fees per sq ft, room refresh budgets, full home and office ranges, and what moves the number.</p><span class=\"hx-more\">Read the article</span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"hx-card\" href=\"/insights/design-process-explained/\" data-ih-reveal=\"\">\n            <figure><img src=\"/assets/img/img-81b231a6c390.webp\" alt=\"Bright Woodex studio lounge interior\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"hx-date\">5 min read</span></figure>\n            <h3>How a Woodex project runs</h3><p>From first call to handover: the four first steps plus design, 3D, quantities and build.</p><span class=\"hx-more\">Read the article</span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"hx-card\" href=\"/insights/3d-visualization-guide/\" data-ih-reveal=\"\">\n            <figure><img src=\"/assets/img/img-27c481fa9a3d.webp\" alt=\"Minimal Woodex interior with custom joinery\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"hx-date\">4 min read</span></figure>\n            <h3>See the room before it exists</h3><p>Stills, walkthroughs and 360 views at 4K and up, with 2 revision rounds included.</p><span class=\"hx-more\">Read the article</span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"hx-card\" href=\"/insights/small-space-ideas/\" data-ih-reveal=\"\">\n            <figure><img src=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" alt=\"Compact Woodex residential interior\" width=\"2240\" height=\"1120\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"hx-date\">4 min read</span></figure>\n            <h3>Small rooms that live large</h3><p>Storage walls, sightlines, light and multipurpose zones for compact homes.</p><span class=\"hx-more\">Read the article</span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"hx-card\" href=\"/insights/retail-shop-interior-guide/\" data-ih-reveal=\"\">\n            <figure><img src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Woodex 3D Studio retail showroom\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"hx-date\">5 min read</span></figure>\n            <h3>A shop interior that sells</h3><p>Entrance, path, display, trial and checkout, plus lighting and materials that last.</p><span class=\"hx-more\">Read the article</span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"hx-card\" href=\"/insights/office-interior-guide/\" data-ih-reveal=\"\">\n            <figure><img src=\"/assets/img/img-5048d9095862.webp\" alt=\"Modern Woodex coworking office interior\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"hx-date\">5 min read</span></figure>\n            <h3>An office that works as hard as you do</h3><p>Zoning for focus, meet and social, plus acoustics, daylight and brand cues.</p><span class=\"hx-more\">Read the article</span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"hx-card\" href=\"/insights/restaurant-planning-guide/\" data-ih-reveal=\"\">\n            <figure><img src=\"/assets/img/img-6f26e32ab200.webp\" alt=\"Elegant restaurant dining interior\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"hx-date\">5 min read</span></figure>\n            <h3>Planning a restaurant interior</h3><p>Service flow, seating mix, mood versus durability, and kitchen adjacency.</p><span class=\"hx-more\">Read the article</span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"hx-card\" href=\"/insights/home-renovation-checklist/\" data-ih-reveal=\"\">\n            <figure><img src=\"/assets/img/img-1f4b4ef86cb5.webp\" alt=\"Home interior mid renovation planning\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"hx-date\">5 min read</span></figure>\n            <h3>A calm home renovation checklist</h3><p>Survey first, freeze scope, hold a buffer, sequence trades, and live through it.</p><span class=\"hx-more\">Read the article</span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
